WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.712
Yue Fei was a young general of the Southern Song; in silver armor and holding a long spear, he called on his soldiers to resist the Jin bravely and defend the country.

00:00:12.062 --> 00:00:21.806
He led his army with strict discipline, personally drilling the soldiers every day; the ranks were perfectly ordered, and all his men respected and loved him.

00:00:22.156 --> 00:00:33.076
On the battlefield the soldiers cheered their victory; the banners of Yue Fei's army flew high as everyone celebrated the recovered land together.

00:00:33.426 --> 00:00:41.298
After the lost land was recovered, the people lined the streets in welcome, warmly thanking the general for protecting their homes.

00:00:41.648 --> 00:00:48.608
The villagers brought food to reward the army, and Yue Fei bowed deeply to thank everyone.

00:00:48.958 --> 00:00:57.958
To this day, people still remember Yue Fei of 'Serve the Country with Utmost Loyalty', and pay him tribute under the warm evening sun.

